### Read
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/watchlists/me

### Four operations
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/watchlists/me/operations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId":"web",
  "baseVersion":0,
  "operations":[
    {"operationId":"web-01","type":"ADD","symbol":"BNB","note":"Track BNB"},
    {"operationId":"web-02","type":"REMOVE","symbol":"FPT"},
    {"operationId":"web-03","type":"UPDATE_NOTE","symbol":"ETH","note":"Support zone"},
    {"operationId":"web-04","type":"MOVE","symbol":"BTC","afterSymbol":"BNB"}
  ]
}

### Changes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/watchlists/me/changes?sinceVersion=0
